          "short": "14 years.\n\nCompare the populations at 13 and 14 years.",
          "worked": "The graph crosses $y=3200$ between 13 and 14 years. Check the neighbouring whole years with a calculator:\n$$\\begin{align*}P(13)&=4200(0.98)^{13}\\\\P(13)&\\approx3229.89\\\\P(14)&=4200(0.98)^{14}\\\\P(14)&\\approx3165.30\\end{align*}$$\nSince $3229.89>3200$ and $3165.30<3200$, the minimum number of whole years is 14.",
